/Write a MARIE program to input any data from the keyboard 
/and display in the MARIE simulator output window
/Modify your program to store the input data in “numIn” and add ‘1’ to it 
/before displaying it in the output. 
/Please input decimal numbers (from the keyboard) for this task.
Input
Store numIn
Add One
Output
Halt

numIn,      DEC 0
One,        DEC 1